:: c01.s01.P01
<<set $stress to Math.max(0, Math.min(100, $stress + 2))>>
<img src="images/c01s01p01.png"/>

Cold hangs in the empty wooden attic. At its center, Leon sits facing the wall, his muttering uneven in the dark.

<p class="dialogue">“Another day, another night. How long has it been? Does it matter?”</p>
<p class="dialogue">“Does anyone even care? I keep asking the wall, and it keeps giving me the same answer.”</p>
<<if visited("c01.s01.P01") > 1>>
<p class="dialogue">“That feeling again. If somebody's there, I don't know what you expect me to say.”</p>
<</if>>
<<timedprogressbar $timer>>
<<goto "c01.s01.P02">>
<</timedprogressbar>>
[[Listen to Leon's muttering|c01.s01.P02]]
[[Glance across the wooden attic|c01.s01.P03]]

:: c01.s01.P02
<<set $stress to Math.max(0, Math.min(100, $stress + 4))>>
<<set $anger to Math.max(0, Math.min(100, $anger + 4))>>
<img src="images/c01s01p02.png"/>

Leon remains hunched toward the wall, withered and frail. His shoulders stiffen between breaths, defining the space behind him as a boundary.

<p class="dialogue">“I can feel a room change, you know. Doesn't mean I know what's in it.”</p>
<p class="dialogue">“If someone's standing back there, stay where I can bear it. I haven't got the strength for a surprise.”</p>
<<if visited("c01.s01.P02") > 1>><p class="dialogue">“Still can't make myself turn around. Give me a minute.”</p><</if>>
<<timedprogressbar $timer>>
<<goto "c01.s01.P03">>
<</timedprogressbar>>
[[Try to close the distance to Leon|c01.s01.P10]]
[[Hold your gaze on the wall beyond Leon|c01.s01.P04]]

:: c01.s01.P03
<<set $stress to Math.max(0, Math.min(100, $stress + 2))>>
<img src="images/c01s01p03.png"/>

Darkness fills the cold attic. Leon's muttering pauses, then resumes before the silence can settle.

<p class="dialogue">“I used to think there'd be a day when it all made sense. Now I can't even tell one night from the next.”</p>
<p class="dialogue">“Maybe I should stop talking. But it's a long time to sit here with nothing but the boards creaking.”</p>
<<if visited("c01.s01.P03") > 1>><p class="dialogue">“There I go again. I wonder if the house ever gets tired of it.”</p><</if>>
<<timedprogressbar $timer>>
<<goto "c01.s01.P04">>
<</timedprogressbar>>
[[Watch Leon's frail shoulders|c01.s01.P06]]

:: c01.s01.P04
<<set $stress to Math.max(0, Math.min(100, $stress + 4))>>
<<set $anger to Math.max(0, Math.min(100, $anger + 4))>>
<img src="images/c01s01p04.png"/>

Leon shakes his head, still facing the wall. The notes lie within his downward gaze.

<p class="dialogue">“I deserve my fate. No... it's her fault.”</p>
<p class="dialogue">“That's easy to say when she isn't here to answer. Doesn't make it go away, either.”</p>
<<if visited("c01.s01.P04") > 1>><p class="dialogue">“Same two answers, and neither one lets me sleep.”</p><</if>>
<<timedprogressbar $timer>>
<<goto "c01.s01.P06">>
<</timedprogressbar>>
[[Notice the notes|c01.s01.P05]]

:: c01.s01.P05
<<set $stress to Math.max(0, Math.min(100, $stress + 4))>>
<img src="images/c01s01p05.png"/>

The notes rustle as Leon bends nearer, their pages still beneath his gaze.

<p class="dialogue">“My memories have started to blur. I wrote notes so I wouldn't forget.”</p>
<p class="dialogue">“But reading feels worse. A few words and the pain comes back like it never left.”</p>
<<if visited("c01.s01.P05") > 1>><p class="dialogue">“They're still here. I suppose I wanted them to be.”</p><</if>>
<<timedprogressbar $timer>>
<<goto "c01.s01.P08">>
<</timedprogressbar>>
[[Study the notes from a distance|c01.s01.P07]]

:: c01.s01.P06
<<set $stress to Math.max(0, Math.min(100, $stress - 4))>>
<<set $anger to Math.max(0, Math.min(100, $anger - 4))>>
<img src="images/c01s01p06.png"/>

Leon is still muttering, but his jaw eases as the words trail off.

<p class="dialogue">“It's her fault... Maybe it isn't that simple. Maybe no one's to blame, and this is just life.”</p>
<p class="dialogue">“I don't know if that's kinder or worse. At least there's a little room to breathe before I decide.”</p>
<<if visited("c01.s01.P06") > 1>><p class="dialogue">“I can sit with that for another moment, I think.”</p><</if>>
<<timedprogressbar $timer>>
<<goto "c01.s01.P08">>
<</timedprogressbar>>
<<if visited("c01.s01.P04") >= 2>>[[Follow the pauses in Leon's muttering|c01.s01.P14]]<</if>>
[[Listen through the unfinished murmur|c01.s01.P09]]

:: c01.s01.P07
<<set $stress to Math.max(0, Math.min(100, $stress + 2))>>
<<set $anger to Math.max(0, Math.min(100, $anger + 8))>>
<img src="images/c01s01p07.png"/>

Leon bows over the notes, his fingers curling beside the paper. A faint rustle interrupts the stillness.

<p class="dialogue">“I wrote those down because I was afraid of losing them. Doesn't mean I want anyone going through them.”</p>
<p class="dialogue">“I can barely stand to read them myself. Leave me a little time with what I remember.”</p>
<<if visited("c01.s01.P07") > 1>><p class="dialogue">“They're right where I left them. That's enough for now.”</p><</if>>
<<timedprogressbar $timer>>
<<goto "c01.s01.P08">>
<</timedprogressbar>>
<<if $stress >= 12>>[[Try to reach toward the notes|c01.s01.P11]]<</if>>
[[Try to draw your attention back from the notes|c01.s01.P06]]

:: c01.s01.P08
<<set $stress to Math.max(0, Math.min(100, $stress - 4))>>
<<set $anger to Math.max(0, Math.min(100, $anger - 2))>>
<img src="images/c01s01p08.png"/>

Leon's voice thins in the cold attic. His hunched back rises and falls as he waits for his next thought.

<p class="dialogue">“I'm going in circles. I wrote it down so I wouldn't forget, and now reading it brings the pain back.”</p>
<p class="dialogue">“So I sit here instead. Some days I think I'm just rotting away, waiting for an answer I already lost.”</p>
<<if visited("c01.s01.P10") >= 1 || visited("c01.s01.P11") >= 1>><p class="dialogue">“It's quiet again. I don't know why that feels different this time.”</p><<elseif visited("c01.s01.P08") > 1>><p class="dialogue">“Back to that same thought. Maybe I can let it pass this time.”</p><</if>>
<<timedprogressbar $timer>>
<<goto "c01.s01.P09">>
<</timedprogressbar>>
[[Lower your gaze from Leon's hunched back|c01.s01.P09]]
<<if visited("c01.s01.P10") >= 1 || visited("c01.s01.P11") >= 1>>[[Try to shift farther from Leon|c02.s01.P01]]<</if>>

:: c01.s01.P09
<<set $stress to Math.max(0, Math.min(100, $stress - 2))>>
<<set $anger to Math.max(0, Math.min(100, $anger - 2))>>

In the cold wooden attic, Leon lets a breath finish before he speaks again.

<p class="dialogue">“Another day, another night. I keep saying it like the words might tell me how long I've been here.”</p>
<p class="dialogue">“Maybe I don't have to know tonight. Maybe I can just sit a while.”</p>
<<if visited("c01.s01.P09") > 1>><p class="dialogue">“There's that quiet again. I'll take it while it lasts.”</p><</if>>
<<timedprogressbar $timer>>
<<goto "c01.s01.P03">>
<</timedprogressbar>>
[[Attend to the silence between breaths|c01.s01.P06]]

:: c01.s01.P10 [blood-red]
<img src="images/c01s01p10.png"/>

Before the attempted approach resolves, Leon lashes backward at the presence he suspects behind him. The blow breaks your neck. His frailty had concealed his terror of someone at his back.

[[Respawn|c01.s01.P12]]

:: c01.s01.P11 [blood-red]
<img src="images/c01s01p11.png"/>

Before your attempt to reach the notes resolves, Leon folds over them and strikes toward the attention he fears. The impact stops your breath for good. He cannot bear to read the memories, yet guards them fiercely.

[[Respawn|c01.s01.P13]]

:: c01.s01.P12
<<set $stress to Math.max(0, Math.min(100, Math.floor($stress / 2)))>>
<<set $anger to 0>>
<img src="images/c01s01p12.png"/>

The cold attic surrounds you again. Leon faces the wall; his shoulders tense before his voice returns.

<p class="dialogue">“Thought I heard something behind me. Damn it, I can't even trust the quiet.”</p>
<p class="dialogue">“Just give me some space. I need a minute to know where I am.”</p>
<<if visited("c01.s01.P12") > 1>><p class="dialogue">“That feeling comes back so easily.”</p><</if>>
<<timedprogressbar $timer>>
<<goto "c01.s01.P01">>
<</timedprogressbar>>

:: c01.s01.P13
<<set $stress to Math.max(0, Math.min(100, Math.floor($stress / 2)))>>
<<set $anger to 0>>
<img src="images/c01s01p13.png"/>

Leon mutters again beside the notes. Their faint rustle recalls the fatal strike.

<p class="dialogue">“I thought somebody wanted those pages. Maybe it was just the house settling.”</p>
<p class="dialogue">“I don't want to lose what I wrote. I just can't bring myself to look at it yet.”</p>
<<if visited("c01.s01.P13") > 1>><p class="dialogue">“They're safe for another moment, at least.”</p><</if>>
<<timedprogressbar $timer>>
<<goto "c01.s01.P01">>
<</timedprogressbar>>

:: c01.s01.P14
<<set $stress to Math.max(0, Math.min(100, $stress - 2))>>

Leon falls quiet around the familiar words. In the attic, the pause lasts longer than his breath.

<p class="dialogue">“Another day, another night. I deserve my fate...”</p>
<p class="dialogue">“I keep saying that like it's settled. I don't know. Maybe I'm only used to hearing it.”</p>
<<if visited("c01.s01.P14") > 1>><p class="dialogue">“Still don't know what comes after that.”</p><</if>>
<<timedprogressbar $timer>>
<<goto "c01.s01.P09">>
<</timedprogressbar>>
[[Hold your attention through Leon's hesitation|c01.s01.P08]]

